  "description": "A .NET port of Apache Tika's content type detection. It bundles Tika's MIME database and detects the media type of a file from its content and name, including formats inside ZIP and OLE2 containers.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "Omne.TikaContentDetector",
